utton class=\"SplashScreen-module__I3M2YW__skip\">Skip <i class=\"bx bx-chevron-right\"></i></button></div><nav class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__nav  \"><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__inner\"><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logo\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/images/cava-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Cava Logo\" class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoImg\"/><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoInfo\"><span class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoText\">Cavallery.id</span><span class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoSub\">Fanbase of Catherina Vallencia</span></div></a><ul class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__links\"><li><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__link \" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">News<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">About<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__link \" href=\"/schedule\">Schedule</a></li><li><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__link \" href=\"/merchandise\">Merchandise</a></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">Project<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">Corner<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li></li></ul><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__burger\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><i class=\"bx bx-menu\"></i></button></div></nav><main><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__page\"><section class=\"page-module__jNXRga__hero\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__heroContent\"><h1 class=\"page-module__jNXRga__title\">#CatErine17th</h1><p class=\"page-module__jNXRga__subtitle\">Erine&#x27;s 17th Birthday Project</p></div></section><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__dividerWrap\"><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__line\"></div><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__icon\">♞</div><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__line\"></div></div><section class=\"page-module__jNXRga__introSection\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__container\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__introBox\"><i class=\"bx bxs-quote-alt-left\"></i><p>Hashtag tersebut merupakan gabungan dari dua kata, yaitu <strong>&quot;Cat&quot;</strong> dan <strong>&quot;Erine&quot;</strong>. Kucing merupakan hewan favorit Erine, yang dikenal sebagai binatang lucu, menggemaskan, namun sesekali dapat menunjukkan sifat pemarah — karakteristik yang selaras dengan kepribadian <strong>@CErine_JKT48</strong>.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__dividerWrap\"><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__line\"></div><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__icon\">♞</div><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__line\"></div></div><section class=\"page-module__jNXRga__projectSection\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__container\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__sectionHeader\"><h2>CatErine17th Offline Project</h2><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__divider\"></div></div><p class=\"page-module__jNXRga__description\">Dalam rangka perayaan STS <strong>@CErine_JKT48</strong> di Theater hari ini, kami telah menyiapkan Display Project di depan Theater yang dapat kalian kunjungi. Selain itu, bagi kalian yang menyaksikan show &quot;Aitakatta&quot; pada pertunjukan hari ini, akan tersedia freebies khusus yang sudah diletakkan di bangku penonton.</p><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__galleryGrid\"><div class=\"glassCard page-module__jNXRga__card\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__imageWrapper\"><img alt=\"Princess CatErine Poster\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__jNXRga__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/caterine17th-poster.jpg\"/></div><h3>Princess CatErine Poster</h3></div><div class=\"glassCard page-module__jNXRga__card\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__imageWrapper\"><img alt=\"Princess CatErine Freebies\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__jNXRga__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/caterine17th-freebies.jpg\"/></div><h3>Princess CatErine Freebies</h3></div><div class=\"glassCard page-module__jNXRga__card\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__imageWrapper\"><img alt=\"Princess CatErine Encore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"page-module__jNXRga__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/caterine17th-encore.png\"/></div><h3>Princess CatErine Encore</h3></div></div></div></section><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__dividerWrap\"><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__line\"></div><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__icon\">♞</div><div class=\"SectionDivider-module__gOjMsG__line\"></div></div><section class=\"page-module__jNXRga__closingSection\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__container\"><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__closingBox\"><h2>Selamat ulang tahun, Erine!</h2><p>Semoga hari ini penuh tawa, doa baik, dan momen manis.</p><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__cats\"><i class=\"bx bxs-cat\"></i><i class=\"bx bxs-cat\"></i><i class=\"bx bxs-cat\"></i></div></div><div class=\"page-module__jNXRga__backBtnWrapper\"><a class=\"page-module__jNXRga__backBtn\" href=\"/\"><i class=\"bx bx-left-arrow-alt\"></i> Kembali ke Home</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"Footer-module__S6Hkya__footer\"><div class=\"Footer-module__S6Hkya__container\"><div class=\"Footer-module__S6Hkya__top\"><div class=\"Footer-module__S6Hkya__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><span class=\"Footer-module__S6Hkya__logoText\">cavallery</span><span class=\"Footer-modu